"No account, and your notebook never passes through our servers. Your phone keeps your notebook, and it moves with your phone's own backups and device transfers. The app stays offline by default, with two exceptions: when you turn on AI grouping it connects to the model provider you choose, and when you use Sync it connects directly to your other device on the same Wi-Fi. Export an encrypted file to keep a backup of your own or to move to another phone." = "没有账号，不经过我们的服务器；密码本由手机保管，跟着手机自己的备份和换机走。App 默认不联网，只在两种时候例外：你打开「AI 分组」时连你选的模型服务商，你用「同步」时在同一个 Wi-Fi 里连你的另一台设备。导出一个加密文件，可以自己留一份备份，或者搬到另一台手机。";
