"Version 4.3" = "第 4.3 版";
"View" = "查看";
"Without a passcode, iPhone does not encrypt your notebook file and anyone holding the phone can open PassBy. Set a passcode in iPhone Settings." = "没有锁屏密码时，iPhone 不会加密密码本文件，拿到手机的人都能打开 PassBy。请在 iPhone 的「设置」里设置锁屏密码。";
"You have no backup yet. Export one and keep it somewhere else." = "你还没有备份。请导出一份，存到别处。";
"You need this code to open the file. Write it down or save it away from the file. PassBy does not keep it; without it the file cannot be opened." = "打开这个文件要用这串导出码。请抄下来，或和文件分开保存。PassBy 不保存导出码，丢了就打不开这个文件。";
"Your draft is kept on this iPhone. Tap New password to resume it." = "草稿留在这台 iPhone 上，点「新建密码」可以继续。";
"Your earlier notebook could not be moved completely, so nothing was changed. It is still on this iPhone. Please try again." = "旧密码本没能完整搬入，所以什么都没有改动。它还在这台 iPhone 上，请再试一次。";
"Your notebook becomes the same as the file. Everything in it now moves to Recently Deleted for 30 days." = "密码本会变成和文件一样。现有的内容移到「最近删除」，保留 30 天。";
"Your notebook changed since the last export, more than 30 days ago." = "上次导出已超过 30 天，这期间密码本有改动。";
"Your notebook from the earlier version has not been moved yet." = "旧版本的密码本还没有搬入。";
"Your notebook has moved." = "密码本已搬入。";
"PassBy asks when you open it, and again after 5 minutes away. Without Face ID it asks for your iPhone passcode." = "打开 PassBy 时验证一次，离开满 5 分钟后再验证。没有 Face ID 时用 iPhone 的锁屏密码。";
"PassBy has no account, so a backup is yours to keep. Export an encrypted file and store it somewhere else. Your notebook is also part of this iPhone’s own backups: turn on Advanced Data Protection for iCloud Backup, or use an encrypted computer backup, so nobody else can read it there." = "PassBy 没有账号，备份要你自己留。请导出一个加密文件，存到别处。密码本也在这台 iPhone 自己的备份里：请为 iCloud 云备份开启「高级数据保护」，或使用加密的电脑备份，这样别人读不到备份里的密码本。";
"PassBy no longer uses an account or iCloud sync. Your notebook from the earlier version is still on this iPhone. PassBy reads it with Face ID and keeps it on this iPhone from now on." = "PassBy 不再使用账号和 iCloud 同步。旧版本的密码本还在这台 iPhone 上，PassBy 用 Face ID 读出它，以后就存在这台 iPhone 上。";
"In short: no account, and your notebook never passes through our servers. Your phone keeps your notebook, and it moves with your phone's own backups and device transfers. The app stays offline by default, with two exceptions: when you turn on AI grouping it connects to the model provider you choose, and when you use Sync it connects directly to your other device on the same Wi-Fi." = "一句话：没有账号，不经过我们的服务器；密码本由手机保管，跟着手机自己的备份和换机走。App 默认不联网，只在两种时候例外：你打开「AI 分组」时连你选的模型服务商，你用「同步」时在同一个 Wi-Fi 里连你的另一台设备。";
"Your entries (title, account, password and notes), folders, Recently Deleted and the date of your last export are kept in one PassBy file on this iPhone, protected by iOS file encryption: the file cannot be read while your iPhone is locked. PassBy adds no key of its own, so your notebook is only as secure as your device passcode and Face ID or Touch ID. Entries in Recently Deleted stay on this iPhone for 30 days, and you can delete them sooner. Deleting PassBy deletes the notebook on this iPhone." = "条目（标题、账号、密码、备注）、分组、「最近删除」和上次导出日期，存在这台 iPhone 上 PassBy 的一个文件里，由 iOS 的文件加密保护：手机锁着时读不出这个文件。PassBy 不另加自己的密钥，所以密码本的安全取决于你的锁屏密码和 Face ID 或触控 ID。「最近删除」里的条目在本机保留 30 天，你也可以提前删除。删除 PassBy 会删掉本机的密码本。";
"Backups and new iPhones" = "系统备份和换手机";
"Your notebook is included in system backups and device transfers, including iCloud Backup, computer backups and Quick Start. Apple or your computer keeps these backups; they do not pass through us. iCloud Backup: unless you turn on Advanced Data Protection, Apple can read the contents of your backup. We recommend turning on Advanced Data Protection where it is available, or using encrypted computer backups instead. Unencrypted computer backups: your notebook is likely stored unencrypted in the backup on your computer. We recommend selecting “Encrypt local backup” in Finder on a Mac, or in the Apple Devices app (or iTunes) on Windows." = "密码本跟着系统备份和换机走，包括 iCloud 云备份、电脑备份和「快速开始」。这些备份由 Apple 或你的电脑保存，不经过我们。iCloud 云备份：没有开启「高级数据保护」时，Apple 能读取备份内容，建议开启高级数据保护，或改用加密的电脑备份。不加密的电脑备份：密码本很可能以明文留在电脑的备份里，建议在 Mac 的「访达」，或 Windows 上的 Apple 设备 App（或 iTunes）里，勾选「加密本地备份」。";
"Encrypted export" = "加密导出";
"An export file is created only when you choose Export. It contains all entries and folders, but not Recently Deleted. It is encrypted with AES-256-GCM, using a key derived from your export code or passphrase with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256. The app generates the export code. We never store the export code or your passphrase; without them the file cannot be opened. You choose where the file goes. We never receive export files. If you save one to iCloud Drive, a computer or another app, that service keeps it under its own terms." = "只有你选择「导出」时才生成导出文件，内容是全部条目和分组，不含「最近删除」。文件用 AES-256-GCM 加密，密钥由导出码或你设的口令经 PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 派生。导出码由 App 生成。我们不保存导出码和口令，丢了就打不开这个文件。文件存到哪里由你选。我们收不到导出文件；存到 iCloud 云盘、电脑或其他 App 的，由那里的服务按其规则保存。";
"Face ID and clipboard" = "Face ID 和剪贴板";
"Face ID and Touch ID are handled by iOS. PassBy receives only the result, never your face or fingerprint data. Copied values stay on this iPhone and expire after 60 seconds; the app you paste into can read them." = "Face ID 和触控 ID 由 iOS 处理，PassBy 只收到验证结果，收不到面部或指纹数据。复制的内容只留在这台 iPhone 上，60 秒后过期；你粘贴进去的 App 能读到它。";
"Network" = "联网";
"PassBy stays offline by default. It does not connect to our servers and includes no third-party advertising, analytics or crash-reporting SDK. It uses the network in only two cases: when you turn on AI grouping, and when you use Sync. Links in the app, such as this policy or Support, open in your browser only when you tap them." = "PassBy 默认不联网，不连我们的服务器，不使用广告、统计或崩溃收集的第三方 SDK。只有两种情况会用到网络：你打开「AI 分组」时，和你用「同步」时。App 里的隐私政策、支持等链接，只在你点了以后用浏览器打开。";
"Information we may receive" = "我们可能收到的信息";
"Crash reports and usage statistics: if you turn on Share With App Developers in Settings › Privacy & Security › Analytics & Improvements, Apple provides us with PassBy crash reports and aggregated usage statistics. They do not include your notebook, and Apple states that they do not identify you personally. Support email: when you email support@tenonai.cn, we receive your email address, your message and anything you attach, and use them only to reply to you. Never send passwords, export codes or your device passcode. Website: when you visit passby.tenonai.cn, our servers record the time, IP address and page requested, and delete these logs automatically after 6 months. Downloads: Apple handles downloads on the App Store; we see only aggregated figures." = "崩溃报告和使用统计：如果你在 iPhone 的「设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 分析与改进」里打开了「与 App 开发者共享」，Apple 会向我们提供 PassBy 的崩溃报告和汇总的使用统计，不含密码本内容；按 Apple 的说明，这些信息不能识别你本人。支持邮件：你发邮件到 support@tenonai.cn 时，我们会收到你的邮箱地址、邮件内容和你附上的信息，只用来答复你；请不要在邮件里发送密码、导出码或设备密码。网站：访问 passby.tenonai.cn 时，服务器会记录访问时间、IP 地址和访问的页面，6 个月后自动删除。下载：PassBy 通过 App Store 提供，下载由 Apple 处理，我们只能看到汇总数据。";
"Data left by earlier versions" = "旧版本留下的数据";
"From version 2.0, PassBy no longer uses Tenon Account sign-in or iCloud sync. Sign-in records that earlier versions left on our servers were deleted when that service shut down. The encrypted notebook that earlier versions synced to iCloud stays in your own iCloud, and we cannot delete it; you can delete PassBy's data when you manage your iCloud storage in iPhone Settings. The earlier notebook file on this iPhone is kept after it is moved into this version." = "从 2.0 起，PassBy 不再使用 Tenon 账号登录和 iCloud 同步。旧版本登录时留在我们服务器上的记录，已在旧服务停用时删除。旧版本同步到你 iCloud 里的加密密码本，留在你自己的 iCloud 里，我们无法删除；你可以在 iPhone 的「设置」里管理 iCloud 储存空间时，删除 PassBy 的数据。这台 iPhone 上的旧密码本文件，搬入这个版本后仍然保留。";
"Your rights" = "你的权利";
"You can access, copy, correct or delete your personal information, withdraw consent, or ask us to explain how we handle it. You manage your notebook yourself in the app. For anything else, email support@tenonai.cn and we will reply within 15 working days." = "你可以查阅、复制、更正、删除你的个人信息，撤回同意，或要求我们解释处理规则。密码本在 App 里由你自己管理；其他请求请发邮件至 support@tenonai.cn，我们会在 15 个工作日内答复。";
"Ask for the passcode to open" = "打开时验证锁屏密码";
"Sync" = "同步";
"With another device on the same Wi-Fi. Nothing passes through our servers." = "和同一个 Wi-Fi 里的另一台设备同步，不经过我们的服务器。";
"No account; nothing passes through our servers" = "没有账号，不经过我们的服务器";
"On the same Wi-Fi, sync this iPhone’s notebook with another phone, or with the web page on a computer. What is sent is encrypted and goes only between the two devices, never through our servers." = "在同一个 Wi-Fi 下，把这台 iPhone 的密码本和另一台手机、或电脑上的网页同步。内容加密后只在这两台设备之间传，不经过我们的服务器。";
"This iPhone" = "这台 iPhone";
"Address" = "地址";
"Pairing code" = "配对码";
"Stop" = "停止";
"Enter this address and code on the other device. It can connect only while this page is open, and the code is new every time." = "在另一台设备上输入这个地址和配对码。这个页面开着才能连，离开就断开；配对码每次都换。";
"Let another device connect" = "让别的设备连过来";
"Send the address to a computer" = "把地址发到电脑";
"Open in Chrome or Edge on your computer to sync with PassBy on your phone: %@" = "在电脑的 Chrome 或 Edge 里打开，和手机上的 PassBy 同步：%@";
"The link holds only this iPhone’s address on the local network, not the pairing code. Open it in Chrome or Edge on the computer." = "链接里只有这台 iPhone 在局域网里的地址，没有配对码。在电脑的 Chrome 或 Edge 里打开。";
"Connect to another phone" = "连到另一台手机";
"On the other phone, tap “Let another device connect” first, then enter the address and code it shows." = "先在另一台手机上点「让别的设备连过来」，再把它显示的地址和配对码填在这里。";
"Syncing…" = "正在同步…";
"Synced" = "同步完成";
"Both were already the same. Nothing changed." = "两边已经一样，没有改动。";
"%d added, %d updated, %d removed." = "新增 %d 条，更新 %d 条，删除 %d 条。";
"%d changed on both devices, and both versions were kept: the other one has “Conflict copy” in its title." = "有 %d 条两边都改过，两份都留下了：标题带「冲突副本」的是另一份。";
"Entries deleted on the other device are in Recently Deleted and can be put back within 30 days." = "另一台设备删掉的条目在「最近删除」里，30 天内可以放回。";
" (Conflict copy)" = "（冲突副本）";
"Stopped after 10 minutes without a connection." = "10 分钟没有设备连接，已停止。";
"Stopped after 5 wrong codes. Starting again gives a new code." = "配对码输错了 5 次，已停止。重新开始会换一个新的配对码。";
"Could not keep listening and stopped. Check that PassBy is allowed to use the local network in iPhone Settings." = "无法继续，已停止。请在 iPhone 的「设置」里确认 PassBy 可以使用本地网络。";
"This iPhone is not on Wi-Fi or a local network." = "这台 iPhone 没有连上 Wi-Fi 或局域网。";
"Could not start. Please try again." = "无法开始，请再试一次。";
"The address is the one shown on the other phone, like 192.168.1.20:52814." = "地址是另一台手机上显示的那一串，像 192.168.1.20:52814。";
"The pairing code is 12 letters and digits." = "配对码是 12 位字母和数字。";
"The notebook changed during the sync. Please sync again." = "同步时密码本有改动，请再同步一次。";
"The sync did not finish and nothing was changed. Update PassBy on both devices and try again." = "同步没有完成，没有做任何改动。把两台设备的 PassBy 都更新到最新再试。";
"Could not connect. Check that both devices are on the same Wi-Fi, that the sync page is open on the other phone, and that PassBy is allowed to use the local network in iPhone Settings." = "连不上。确认两台设备在同一个 Wi-Fi，另一台手机的同步页面开着，并且在 iPhone 的「设置」里允许了 PassBy 使用本地网络。";
"The other phone did not accept. The code is wrong or has already been used: start again there and use the new code." = "另一台手机没有接受。配对码不对，或者已经用过了：在那边重新开始，用新的配对码。";
"The other phone has stopped. Start again there." = "另一台手机已经停止，请在那边重新开始。";
"The reply could not be verified. Nothing was changed." = "对方的回复验证不过，没有做任何改动。";
"AI grouping" = "AI 分组";
"Off" = "已关闭";
"On. Connects to the network when used" = "已打开，使用时会联网";
"Lets an AI model you choose sort your passwords into folders by their titles, and suggest tidier titles. It sends to the provider you choose only when you tap Send, and it is off by default." = "让你选的 AI 模型按标题把密码分到文件夹里，并给标题提出更规范的写法。只有你点「发送」时才会发给你选的服务商，默认关闭。";
"The AI gets titles and folder names only." = "AI 只拿到标题和文件夹名。";
"The account, password and notes fields are never sent. Before each send, you can see everything that will go out." = "账户、密码、备注这三栏不会发送。每次发送前，你都能看到要发出去的全部内容。";
"Turn on AI grouping" = "打开 AI 分组";
"When on, PassBy sends to the provider only when you tap Send. Turning it off deletes the API key and these settings." = "打开后，只有你点「发送」时才向服务商发送。关闭时会删除 API Key 和这里的设置。";
"Model provider" = "模型服务商";
"Endpoint" = "接口地址";
"Model name" = "模型名称";
"The endpoint has to start with https://." = "接口地址要以 https:// 开头。";
"The provider’s address has changed. Saving deletes the API key you entered, and you will need to enter one again." = "换了服务商的地址，保存后原来的 API Key 会被删除，需要重新填写。";
"The endpoint filled in by default is DeepSeek’s; you can change it to any provider with a compatible chat/completions endpoint. The service is provided by that provider under its own terms and privacy policy; with a provider outside mainland China, your titles are sent abroad." = "默认填的是 DeepSeek 的接口地址，可以换成其他兼容 chat/completions 接口的服务商。服务由服务商提供，按它自己的协议和隐私政策处理；填境外服务商时，标题会发往境外。";
"Use the DeepSeek defaults" = "恢复 DeepSeek 默认";
"API key" = "API Key";
"API key saved" = "API Key 已保存";
"Save API key" = "保存 API Key";
"Show API key" = "显示 API Key";
"Hide API key" = "隐藏 API Key";
"The API key is one you get from the provider yourself; its charges are between you and the provider. It is kept in this iPhone’s keychain, does not move to another device with a backup, is left out of export files, and is not shown again once saved. Uninstalling PassBy does not remove it; turn AI grouping off first." = "API Key 是你自己在服务商那里申请的，费用由你和服务商结算。它保存在这台 iPhone 的钥匙串里，不会随备份转到别的设备，不进导出文件，保存后不再显示。卸载 PassBy 不会删除它，卸载前请先关闭 AI 分组。";
"Start grouping" = "开始分组";
"The next page shows what will be sent. Nothing is sent yet." = "下一步先给你看要发送的内容，不会直接发送。";
"Turn on AI grouping?" = "打开 AI 分组？";
"Once this is on, PassBy sends one request to the provider each time you tap Send, and at no other time." = "打开后，只有你每次点「发送」时，PassBy 才向服务商发一次请求。";
"Only your entries’ titles and your folder names are sent. Accounts, passwords and notes are never sent." = "发送的只有条目的标题和文件夹名。账户、密码、备注不会发送。";
"What you send goes from this iPhone straight to the provider you entered, not through us. The service is provided by that provider under its own terms and privacy policy; with a provider outside mainland China, the content is sent abroad. An account name or a person’s name written into a title is sent along with it." = "内容从这台 iPhone 直接发给你填的模型服务商，不经过我们。这项服务由服务商提供，按它自己的协议和隐私政策处理；选境外服务商时，内容会发往境外。标题里如果写了账号或姓名，会随标题一起发出。";
"The API key is stored encrypted on this iPhone only." = "API Key 只加密保存在这台 iPhone 上。";
"Turn on" = "打开";
"Turn off AI grouping?" = "关闭 AI 分组？";
"This deletes the API key and provider settings saved on this iPhone. Your notebook is not affected. Once off, PassBy no longer connects to the provider." = "会删除这台 iPhone 上保存的 API Key 和服务商设置。密码本不受影响。关闭后 PassBy 不再连接服务商。";
"Turn off" = "关闭";
"Check what will be sent" = "确认要发送的内容";
"The text below will be sent to the provider you set up (%@)." = "下面这些文字会发给你配置的服务商（%@）。";
"At most %d titles are sent at once. %d more are not sent this time." = "一次最多发送 %d 个标题，另有 %d 个这次不发送。";
"%d entries have no title. They are not sent and go straight to To clarify." = "有 %d 条没有标题，不会发送，会直接放进「待明确」。";
"Titles (%d)" = "标题（%d 个）";
"Existing folders (%d)" = "现有文件夹（%d 个）";
"No folders yet." = "还没有文件夹。";
"Show the full request" = "查看完整请求";
"Hide the full request" = "收起完整请求";
"This is the request exactly as it will be sent. It starts with a fixed instruction, followed by the titles and folder names above. The API key goes in a request header and is not shown here." = "这是将要发出的请求原文。开头是固定的说明文字，后面是上面的标题和文件夹名。API Key 放在请求头里，不在这里显示。";
"Send" = "发送";
"Sent. Waiting for the model to start answering… (%d s)" = "已发送，正在等模型开始回复…（%d 秒）";
"The model is answering: %d of %d suggestions received (%d s)" = "模型正在回复：已收到 %d / %d 条建议（%d 秒）";
"Stop waiting" = "不等了";
"Nothing to send" = "没有要发送的内容";
"The endpoint is not right. Go back and check it. Nothing was sent." = "接口地址不对，请回到上一页检查。没有发送任何内容。";
"There is no usable API key. Go back and enter it again. Nothing was sent." = "没有可用的 API Key，请回到上一页重新填写。没有发送任何内容。";
"Could not reach the provider. Check the network and the endpoint." = "连不上服务商，请检查网络和接口地址。";
"The provider did not answer in time. Try again later." = "服务商没有在限定时间内回复，请稍后再试。";
"The provider asked to go to another address (status %d). PassBy does not follow redirects. Check the endpoint." = "服务商要求跳转到别的地址（状态码 %d），PassBy 不跟随跳转。请检查接口地址。";
"The provider refused this API key (status %d). Check the key and your balance." = "服务商拒绝了这个 API Key（状态码 %d）。请检查 API Key 和账户余额。";
"The provider returned an error (status %d). Check the endpoint and the model name." = "服务商返回了错误（状态码 %d）。请检查接口地址和模型名称。";
"The AI’s answer was not in the agreed form. Nothing was changed. Try again, or use another model." = "AI 的回复不是约定的格式，没有改动任何内容。可以再试一次，或换一个模型。";
"To clarify" = "待明确";
"The AI’s suggestions" = "AI 的建议";
"Tick the suggestions to accept. Nothing changes until you tap Apply. Only titles and folders change; no password is deleted." = "勾选要采用的建议，点「应用」后才会改动。只会改标题和文件夹，不会删除任何密码。";
"Select all" = "全选";
"Select none" = "全不选";
"Folders and titles (%d)" = "分组和标题（%d 条）";
"To clarify (%d)" = "待明确（%d 条）";
"These titles do not say what they are for. Ticked ones go into the To clarify folder; or tap the pencil to edit a title first." = "这些标题看不出是什么。勾选的会放进「待明确」文件夹；也可以点右边的笔先改标题。";
"Nothing to change" = "没有需要改动的";
"The AI finds the current titles and folders fine." = "AI 认为现在的标题和分组已经合适。";
"(no title)" = "（没有标题）";
"%@ → %@" = "%@ → %@";
"Edit title" = "改标题";
"Apply %d" = "应用 %d 条";
"Applied %d suggestions" = "已应用 %d 条建议";
"An API key can hold only letters, digits and symbols, with no spaces, line breaks or other characters. Check that nothing else was copied with it." = "API Key 里只能有英文字母、数字和符号，不能有空格、换行或中文。请检查是不是多复制了别的内容。";
"Undo" = "撤销";
"Sync happens only when you start it in Settings › Sync, with another device on the same local network. The two devices connect directly; nothing passes through our servers. All entries and folders are sent, encrypted with a key derived from the pairing code. The first time, iOS asks whether PassBy may use the local network. See the online privacy policy for details." = "同步只在你到「设置 › 同步」里开始时进行，对象是同一个局域网里的另一台设备。两台设备直接相连，不经过我们的服务器。传的是全部条目和文件夹，用配对码派生的密钥加密。第一次同步时，系统会询问是否允许 PassBy 使用「本地网络」。详见线上的隐私政策。";
"AI grouping is off by default. It uses the model provider you choose and your own API key; the service is provided by that provider, not by us. Only after you tap Send does PassBy send your entries' titles and folder names from this iPhone straight to that provider; accounts, passwords and notes are never sent, and nothing passes through our servers. Your API key is kept in the iOS keychain on this device only. Uninstalling PassBy does not remove it; turn AI grouping off first. See the online privacy policy for details." = "AI 分组默认关闭。它用的是你自己选的模型服务商和你自己的 API Key，这项服务由服务商提供，不是我们提供的。你点「发送」后，PassBy 才从这台 iPhone 把条目的标题和文件夹名称直接发给这家服务商；账户、密码和备注不会发送，也不经过我们的服务器。API Key 存在 iOS 钥匙串里，只存在这台设备上。卸载 PassBy 不会删掉它，卸载前请先关闭 AI 分组。详见线上的隐私政策。";
"Publisher" = "出品方";
